# Wikiloc scraper — local-only artifacts. The .ts files under
# packages/api/scripts/wikiloc/output/ are intentionally kept under version
# control (they're the trail catalogue the seed SQL is generated from), but
# everything else under that folder is derived/transient state that should
# never reach git.
packages/api/scripts/wikiloc/output/_summits.json
packages/api/scripts/wikiloc/output/_chain.log
packages/api/scripts/wikiloc/output/_backfill.log
packages/api/scripts/wikiloc/output/_failures.json

# Agent-tooling state (per-cwd; harmless duplicates show up when Claude is
# launched from a subpackage). The repo only intentionally commits files
# under .claude/skills/ at the monorepo root.
**/.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
**/.claude/settings.local.json
